full-query: "You are working on a small project for your personal usage. The application is hosted in an Auto Scaling group. There is only 1 instance in the ASG and the EC2 instance may be terminated and recreated from time to time. The EC2 DNS name and IP are changed when a new instance is launched in the ASG. You own a hosted zone in Route 53 and plan to create a record set to route the traffic to the instance. You have very limited budget. Which method is the most cost-efficient to update the record set dynamically?"
